                        "entry_id": "b7f67746-bb04-31d4-8fd7-ed889740a990",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person who deserves to be, or is likely to be, hanged; a gallows bird."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b4f0cc53-b2f3-4c1d-bea5-14c2a9b893ba",
                                "sense_id": "acf09797-50b2-3a2d-b5c7-efd51f9826ea",
                                "text": "Hark ye, ye crack-rope padder, born beggar, and bred thief!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8b216c47-02f2-4f76-9691-97b191bb56e0",
                                "sense_id": "acf09797-50b2-3a2d-b5c7-efd51f9826ea",
                                "text": "Jack. Master, I handled you not, but who did handle you very handsomely, you can tell.\nCarisophus. Handsomely, thou crack-rope?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "748b7a48-7aac-4dec-a974-cd9ee506529d",
                                "sense_id": "acf09797-50b2-3a2d-b5c7-efd51f9826ea",
                                "text": "Then let him be led through every ſtreete in yᵉ towne, / That every crackrope, may throw rottē egs at yᵉ clown."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
